# The WordPress export and its redacted copy. The raw export carries 750
# commenter email addresses and 476 IP addresses and must never be committed to
# a public repo; the redacted copy is safe but large, and is regenerable with
# `cargo run --bin redact`. See tools/wp-comments/README.md.
*.wordpress.*.xml
